{"parse": {"title": "信风花园", "pageid": 69029, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"信风花园\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b3/Item-240002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"信风花园\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>信风花园</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#240002</div></div><hr /><div></div><div style=\"color:#696969\">太阳热烈，微风清凉。当第一片花瓣凋落，熟悉而湿润的季风开始离岸。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">黄昏的音序</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.88.9D.E6.AC.A1.E6.8D.A2.E8.A3.85.E5.89.A7.E6.83.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"初次换装剧情\">初次换装剧情</span></h2>\n<div class=\"episode-switchbtn\" style=\"transform:translateY(0); gap:20px; position:relative; flex-direction:row-reverse; margin-bottom:0.8em;\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_zhujiemian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_zhujiemian\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_zhujiemian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_2_bg_zhujiemian.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhujiemian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_2_bg_zhujiemian.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhujiemian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_2_bg_zhujiemian.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhujiemian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>好耶～维尔汀的布景计划终于大功告成了！星锑小姐计划要开上一天一夜的派对，她好像已经去挨个敲门，向大家派发邀请函了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>派发？如果强塞也算一种邀请的话……总之随她去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>嘿，这些花哨装饰都是头儿一个人收拾的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>是大家一起准备的！你瞧，那株散尾葵就是槲寄生小姐亲手种下——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>咦？昨天它才能碰到我的头，今天怎么已经摸到屋顶了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>难怪现在活像个花园，四面漏风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>花园？我喜欢花园！滴蜜的花，彩虹一样的鸟，就和维尔汀送我的书里讲的一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>书？等会儿——你最近老抱着的那本？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞行女巫用时常旋转钥匙的食指在实木桌子上敲了敲，将小淑女从脑内大冒险中拉回现实，一如戛然而止的蒙太奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>厚重的图画册在桌子的角落摊开摆放着，书页中规整地夹着书签，像是在引导两位新来的读者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>“热带地方的城镇，与其说是深具异域的风味，不如说是旧时风景的再现。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>唔，维尔汀小姐给我读过这段，这是一本讲述南美洲故事的书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>南美洲？最近怎么老听到这个词？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>听说那儿成天又湿又热，跟西伯利亚完全是两种调子……但他们的朗姆酒还不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>在我还没到桌子高的时候，卡森先生就讲过许多“神秘大陆”的故事——悬浮石梯、遍地草药的黄金乡，还有不老泉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>他说，等苏芙比成为成熟的淑女，就可以去那儿冒险了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>红弩箭小姐，你说我现在能不能履行约定去冒险了呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>……这问题得问老天爷，但说不准真能捎上你，一块儿去亚马逊河上兜兜风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>芝诺的电报说，老将军最近调到那一带去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>哇哦！真的吗——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很可惜，绿帽淑女的热带幻想再度被打断，突然归家的箱中主人颔首表示歉意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>抱歉，打断你们了，我说完就会离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>基金会下达了新的任务，我们很快就要动身，出发去圣保罗。</div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "信风花园"}}